src/shim/privacy/data/tr_person_names.json carries, under "first_names", the
Turkish first names of Faker (https://github.com/joke2k/faker,
faker/providers/person/tr_TR), copyright Daniele Faraglia, under the MIT licence
in src/shim/privacy/data/LICENSE.faker, less entries that are ordinary words.
Its other lists ("team_first_names", the common first names Faker lacks;
"ambiguous_first_names"; "surnames"; "following_stopwords") were compiled by the
shim team from general knowledge, from no third-party dataset. They are lists of
facts, and no third-party licence applies to them.
